Here is the patch for Kernels 1.1.45 - 1.1.49 to add the driver.
Just unshar or sh everything between the cut lines. I didn't add the README,
but the building of aic7770 and aha274x_seq.h are incorporated in and happen
automatically, so aha274x_seq.h doesn't need to be sent along.

Just extract the patch, and execute "patch -s < aic7770.patch" in the directory
above the linux directory/symbolic link that is linux-1.1.4[5-9]

